# {{lb|en|printing}} A maker’s mark imprinted on a work to show that it is sanctioned by members of a [[trade union]]. It is often a tiny elongated [[rhomboid]] containing and surrounded by, in minuscule typeface, identifying names and the union’s local chapter number.
#: {{ux|en|Printed matter circulated by the {{lb|en|US}} Democratic Party inevitably displays a '''union bug'''.}}

